# CAL-031 Contract Block 1: the env `supabase functions serve` gets during the
# integration gate. Local, non-secret values only: the edge-runtime container
# reaches the Gemini stub (e2e/fixtures/geminiStub.ts, port 4174) on the host.
#
# No Gemini key line at all. The handler sends whatever the key variable holds
# (empty when unset) and the stub ignores it; and any literal assigned to that
# name is refused by src/deploy/noSecrets.test.ts (CAL-030 AC-5), dummy or not.
GEMINI_API_BASE=http://host.docker.internal:4174
